    "detailed_description": "<h1>Important Notice</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790340/extras/4bd1037da1d8ba0942c369c2cb8ee2f4.avif?t=1722501257\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790340/extras/21e551541203ca417974cff0424b5cdd.avif?t=1722501257\" /></div></p><br><h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>ROADMAP</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790340/extras/9cda587728bc7237adbfc4da800249de.avif?t=1722501257\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790340/extras/b43fb40058c7a643860eb4f4320d6a40.avif?t=1722501257\" /></div><br><br>One, two, all together. Read the room with the world<br> in the online version of the popular KUUKIYOMI series!<br> <br> Over 10 million people have tested their room-reading finesse with KUUKIYOMI,<br> and the latest title can now be played online with people around the world!<br> <br> Up to 7 players can consider the proposed questions<br> together at the same time. After each session, watch<br> everyone's replays and vote for your favorite play or<br> the player who did best.<br> <br> Become the most considerate player by gaining the most votes!<br> <br> We know you will love considering it together with players from all over the world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790340/extras/ae953f6f637243608a1bae3924b570f8.poster.avif?t=1722501257\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790340/extras/ae953f6f637243608a1bae3924b570f8.webm?t=1722501257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790340/extras/ae953f6f637243608a1bae3924b570f8.mp4?t=1722501257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790340/extras/27fffb1b21123b666bc0fa5ca3f1c7ce.avif?t=1722501257\" /></div><br><br>You will receive three questions.<br> Consider the situation and move the red object on the screen.<br> If there is nothing to move, read the room and do as appropriate.<br> <br> There are plenty of interesting questions to ponder!<br> For example, how can you be considerate swankily? Vaguely? Or even adamantly?<br> And there's more!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790340/extras/c2f0ae1dcb42e3aa23af5f20c9a62a11.avif?t=1722501257\" /></div><br><br>Vote for your favorite player or the one who answered the question best.<br> The winner is decided based on points from the sum of votes received and bonuses from the &quot;Loner&quot; (received no votes) or<br> &quot;Mutual Affection&quot; (voted for each other) titles. Don't worry if you don't win. Keep playing to get a higher rank<br> and earn avatars or KY coins that can be used to purchase avatars.<br> <br> Each play session is like a short breather that<br> makes you smile and forget a stressful day.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790340/extras/add5e0fe2cc6dec15cde8948c176e831.avif?t=1722501257\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790340/extras/aac3b43544afa9da72c4778f208c9b56.avif?t=1722501257\" /></div><br><br>1. Up to 7 players are matched for each session.<br>2. Once matching is complete, the game starts.<br>3. You are given a question, and you will play a mini-game based on the question.<br>4. After the mini-game is over, you will watch the replays of all other players.<br>5. After watching, vote for the player who played the best according to the theme.<br>6. Play mini-game, watch replays, and vote. Do this three times.<br>7. The winner is the player with the most votes from all three rounds.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790340/extras/4fed77082cab07114456d5cd4126cc02.avif?t=1722501257\" /></div><br><br>Be flashy! Cool! Plain! Consider using different styles for different occasions!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790340/extras/22de7159c8a3f2ac817805ced7162d43.poster.avif?t=1722501257\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790340/extras/22de7159c8a3f2ac817805ced7162d43.webm?t=1722501257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790340/extras/22de7159c8a3f2ac817805ced7162d43.mp4?t=1722501257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><u>\u25a0About the Controller</u></strong><br>This game is compatible with various controllers.<br>For details on settings, etc., please refer to the following URL.<br><br><br><strong><u>\u25a0How to solve the problem to purchase items in the Shop</u></strong><br>If you have disabled the Steam overlay setting, <br>you will not be able to purchase any items in the Shop.<br>For details on settings, please refer to the following URL.<br>",
